"Wrightwares is the island's largest Wright shop."
"It sells grappling hooks, line launchers, levitating pulleys and self-knotting rope."
"It also sells a portable autoloom, cordage, spell reagents like ice-trap powder and beef jerky."
"Temper spheres sell there in egg-carton packs of twelve, for 200 Argold each."
"Small items are sold from vending machines and large items from cages."
"Explosives require a Grade 3 Tinkering License."
"Alden bought two thousand feet of fire-resistant fluorescent yellow survival paracord there."
